代理）"},{"id":"a-shiji039-013","subject_person_id":"gcb_rf3_coi_B","predicate":"brother","object_person_id":"gcb_rf3_coi_A","status":"source_attested","evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-039-jin","source_id":"s-shiji-039-jin","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-039-jin:p011","quote":"昭侯元年，封文侯弟成師于曲沃。曲沃邑大於翼。翼，晉君都邑也。成師封曲沃，號爲桓叔。靖侯庶孫欒賓相桓叔。桓叔是時年五十八矣，好德，晉國之衆皆附焉。君子曰：「晉之亂其在曲沃矣。末大於本而得民心，不亂何待！」"}],"qualifiers":{"source_term":"文侯弟成師","historicity":"historical_tradition"},"interpretation_note":"保存本段明示親屬或生育敘事；不由繼位補父子，不補闕代。母、女弟、庶孫等依原文；人物暫同指及不同篇主張仍待覆核。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"},{"id":"a-shiji039-016","subject_person_id":"6di_ywz_ju4_A","predicate":"grandfather","object_person_id":"gcb_rf3_coi_B","status":"source_attested","evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-039-jin","source_id":"s-shiji-039-jin","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-039-jin:p022","quote":"武公稱者，先晉穆侯曾孫也，曲沃桓叔孫也。桓叔者，始封曲沃。武公，莊伯子也。自桓叔初封曲沃以至武公滅晉也，凡六十七歳，而卒代晉爲諸侯。武公代晉二歳，卒。與曲沃通年，卽位凡三十九年而卒。子獻公詭諸立。"}],"qualifiers":{"source_term":"曲沃桓叔孫","historicity":"historical_tradition"},"interpretation_note":"保存本段明示親屬或生育敘事；不由繼位補父子，不補闕代。母、女弟、庶孫等依原文；人物暫同指及不同篇主張仍待覆核。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"title_holdings":[],"address_assertions":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[{"id":"d-shiji039-133","person_id":"gcb_rf3_coi_B","surfaces":["成師","曲沃桓叔","桓叔"],"scope":"same_chapter","chapter_ids":["c-shiji-039-jin"],"status":"contextual_provisional","evidence":[{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-039-jin:p007","quote":"穆侯四年，取齊女姜氏爲夫人。七年，伐條。生太子仇。十年，伐千畝，有功。生少子，名曰成師。晉人師服曰：「異哉，君之命子也！太子曰仇，仇者讎也。少子曰成師，成師大號，成之者也。名自命也；物自定也。今適庶名反逆，此後晉其能毋亂乎？」"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-039-jin:p011","quote":"昭侯元年，封文侯弟成師于曲沃。曲沃邑大於翼。翼，晉君都邑也。成師封曲沃，號爲桓叔。靖侯庶孫欒賓相桓叔。桓叔是時年五十八矣，好德，晉國之衆皆附焉。君子曰：「晉之亂其在曲沃矣。末大於本而得民心，不亂何待！」"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-039-jin:p012","quote":"七年，晉大臣潘父弒其君昭侯而迎曲沃桓叔。桓叔欲入晉，晉人發兵攻桓叔。桓叔敗，還歸曲沃。晉人共立昭侯子平爲君，是爲孝侯。誅潘父。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-039-jin:p013","quote":"孝侯八年，曲沃桓叔卒，子胛桓叔，是爲曲沃莊伯。孝侯十五年，曲沃莊伯弒其君晉孝侯于翼。晉人攻曲沃莊伯，莊伯復入曲沃。晉人復立孝侯子郄爲君，是爲鄂侯。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-039-jin:p022","quote":"武公稱者，先晉穆侯曾孫也，曲沃桓叔孫也。桓叔者，始封曲沃。武公，莊伯子也。自桓叔初封曲沃以至武公滅晉也，凡六十七歳，而卒代晉爲諸侯。武公代晉二歳，卒。與曲沃通年，卽位凡三十九年而卒。子獻公詭諸立。"}],"rationale":"按本篇明示名與稱號、晉世系與具體事件暫定所列提及同指；附各段原文，未按同字短名全域合併；紀年與版本差異待核。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:p007","text":"穆侯四年，取齊女姜氏爲夫人。七年，伐條。生太子仇。十年，伐千畝，有功。生少子，名曰成師。晉人師服曰：「異哉，君之命子也！太子曰仇，仇者讎也。少子曰成師，成師大號，成之者也。名自命也；物自定也。今適庶名反逆，此後晉其能毋亂乎？」","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m007-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"穆侯","kind":"person","person_id":"gcb_rf3_coi","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m007-0006","start":6,"end":10,"surface":"齊女姜氏","kind":"person","person_id":"5dh_xqg_em0","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m007-0021","start":21,"end":24,"surface":"太子仇","kind":"person","person_id":"gcb_rf3_coi_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m007-0036","start":36,"end":38,"surface":"少子","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、職官泛稱、校勘、神異或未定指代；不補未見名、成員、爵等或闕代。"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m007-0041","start":41,"end":43,"surface":"成師","kind":"person","person_id":"gcb_rf3_coi_B","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m007-0046","start":46,"end":48,"surface":"師服","kind":"person","person_id":"fbi_2jp_um3","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m007-0060","start":60,"end":62,"surface":"太子","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、職官泛稱、校勘、神異或未定指代；不補未見名、成員、爵等或闕代。"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m007-0070","start":70,"end":72,"surface":"少子","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、職官泛稱、校勘、神異或未定指代；不補未見名、成員、爵等或闕代。"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m007-0073","start":73,"end":75,"surface":"成師","kind":"person","person_id":"gcb_rf3_coi_B","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m007-0076","start":76,"end":78,"surface":"成師","kind":"person","person_id":"gcb_rf3_coi_B","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-039-jin","book_id":"b-shiji-039","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-039-jin"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:p011","text":"昭侯元年，封文侯弟成師于曲沃。曲沃邑大於翼。翼，晉君都邑也。成師封曲沃，號爲桓叔。靖侯庶孫欒賓相桓叔。桓叔是時年五十八矣，好德，晉國之衆皆附焉。君子曰：「晉之亂其在曲沃矣。末大於本而得民心，不亂何待！」","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m011-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"昭侯","kind":"person","person_id":"gcb_rf3_coi_AA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m011-0006","start":6,"end":8,"surface":"文侯","kind":"person","person_id":"gcb_rf3_coi_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m011-0009","start":9,"end":11,"surface":"成師","kind":"person","person_id":"gcb_rf3_coi_B","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m011-0030","start":30,"end":32,"surface":"成師","kind":"person","person_id":"gcb_rf3_coi_B","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m011-0038","start":38,"end":40,"surface":"桓叔","kind":"person","person_id":"gcb_rf3_coi_B","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m011-0041","start":41,"end":43,"surface":"靖侯","kind":"person","person_id":"y4i_pjk_4gn_AAAAAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m011-0045","start":45,"end":47,"surface":"欒賓","kind":"person","person_id":"y4i_pjk_4gn_AAAAAAAA*A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m011-0048","start":48,"end":50,"surface":"桓叔","kind":"person","person_id":"gcb_rf3_coi_B","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m011-0051","start":51,"end":53,"surface":"桓叔","kind":"person","person_id":"gcb_rf3_coi_B","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m011-0064","start":64,"end":68,"surface":"晉國之衆","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、職官泛稱、校勘、神異或未定指代；不補未見名、成員、爵等或闕代。"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m011-0072","start":72,"end":74,"sur