":"c-shiji-039-jin:p013","text":"孝侯八年，曲沃桓叔卒，子胛桓叔，是爲曲沃莊伯。孝侯十五年，曲沃莊伯弒其君晉孝侯于翼。晉人攻曲沃莊伯，莊伯復入曲沃。晉人復立孝侯子郄爲君，是爲鄂侯。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m013-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"孝侯","kind":"person","person_id":"msf_ogd_cah","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m013-0005","start":5,"end":9,"surface":"曲沃桓叔","kind":"person","person_id":"gcb_rf3_coi_B","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m013-0012","start":12,"end":13,"surface":"胛","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"同版原始標記亦如此，句子不通；不以模型補代字或莊伯名字。"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m013-0013","start":13,"end":15,"surface":"桓叔","kind":"person","person_id":"gcb_rf3_coi_B","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m013-0018","start":18,"end":22,"surface":"曲沃莊伯","kind":"person","person_id":"6di_ywz_ju4","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m013-0023","start":23,"end":25,"surface":"孝侯","kind":"person","person_id":"msf_ogd_cah","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m013-0029","start":29,"end":33,"surface":"曲沃莊伯","kind":"person","person_id":"6di_ywz_ju4","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m013-0036","start":36,"end":39,"surface":"晉孝侯","kind":"person","person_id":"msf_ogd_cah","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m013-0045","start":45,"end":49,"surface":"曲沃莊伯","kind":"person","person_id":"6di_ywz_ju4","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m013-0050","start":50,"end":52,"surface":"莊伯","kind":"person","person_id":"6di_ywz_ju4","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m013-0061","start":61,"end":63,"surface":"孝侯","kind":"person","person_id":"msf_ogd_cah","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m013-0064","start":64,"end":65,"surface":"郄","kind":"person","person_id":"l9t_94i_2xm","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m013-0070","start":70,"end":72,"surface":"鄂侯","kind":"person","person_id":"l9t_94i_2xm","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-039-jin","book_id":"b-shiji-039","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-039-jin"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:p022","text":"武公稱者，先晉穆侯曾孫也，曲沃桓叔孫也。桓叔者，始封曲沃。武公，莊伯子也。自桓叔初封曲沃以至武公滅晉也，凡六十七歳，而卒代晉爲諸侯。武公代晉二歳，卒。與曲沃通年，卽位凡三十九年而卒。子獻公詭諸立。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m022-0000","start":0,"end":3,"surface":"武公稱","kind":"person","person_id":"6di_ywz_ju4_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m022-0005","start":5,"end":9,"surface":"先晉穆侯","kind":"person","person_id":"gcb_rf3_coi","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m022-0013","start":13,"end":17,"surface":"曲沃桓叔","kind":"person","person_id":"gcb_rf3_coi_B","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m022-0020","start":20,"end":22,"surface":"桓叔","kind":"person","person_id":"gcb_rf3_coi_B","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m022-0029","start":29,"end":31,"surface":"武公","kind":"person","person_id":"6di_ywz_ju4_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m022-0032","start":32,"end":34,"surface":"莊伯","kind":"person","person_id":"6di_ywz_ju4","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m022-0038","start":38,"end":40,"surface":"桓叔","kind":"person","person_id":"gcb_rf3_coi_B","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m022-0046","start":46,"end":48,"surface":"武公","kind":"person","person_id":"6di_ywz_ju4_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m022-0066","start":66,"end":68,"surface":"武公","kind":"person","person_id":"6di_ywz_ju4_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m022-0092","start":92,"end":96,"surface":"獻公詭諸","kind":"person","person_id":"6di_ywz_ju4_AA","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-039-jin","book_id":"b-shiji-039","w